000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SEQLVL2.
000300* Sequential I-O level 2: LINAGE with FOOTING and a top margin,
000400* END-OF-PAGE, LINAGE-COUNTER, ADVANCING by an identifier and by
000500* a channel mnemonic, SELECT OPTIONAL absent and present, and OPEN
000600* EXTEND on a QSAM file. The print file is read back through a
000700* second FD with the control byte as data, as advance.cbl does,
000800* so the program is its own oracle.
000900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001100 SPECIAL-NAMES.
001200     C01 IS TOP-OF-FORM.
001300 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001400 FILE-CONTROL.
001500     SELECT PRT-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-LINFILE RESERVE 2 AREAS.
001600     SELECT RAW-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-LINFILE.
001700     SELECT OPTIONAL OPT-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-OPTFILE.
001800     SELECT OPTIONAL OPT2-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-OPTFILE2.
001900     SELECT EXT-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-EXTFILE.
002000     SELECT EXT-IN ASSIGN TO UT-S-EXTFILE.
002100 DATA DIVISION.
002200 FILE SECTION.
002300 FD  PRT-FILE
002400     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
002500     LINAGE IS 5 LINES WITH FOOTING AT 4 LINES AT TOP 1.
002600 01  PRT-REC      PIC X(10).
002700 FD  RAW-FILE
002800     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
002900 01  RAW-REC.
003000     02  R-CTL    PIC X.
003100     02  R-TEXT   PIC X(10).
003200 FD  OPT-FILE
003300     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
003400 01  OPT-REC      PIC X(80).
003500 FD  OPT2-FILE
003600     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
003700 01  OPT2-REC     PIC X(80).
003800 FD  EXT-FILE
003900     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
004000 01  EXT-REC      PIC X(10).
004100 FD  EXT-IN
004200     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
004300 01  EXT-IN-REC   PIC X(10).
004400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004500 01  EOF-FLAG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
004600 01  N            PIC 9 VALUE 2.
004700 01  LC-SHOW      PIC 9.
004800 01  CNT          PIC 9 VALUE 0.
004900 01  CARD-SHOW    PIC X(12).
005000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005100 MAIN.
005200     OPEN OUTPUT PRT-FILE.
005300     MOVE 'LINE ONE  ' TO PRT-REC.
005400     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
005500         AT END-OF-PAGE DISPLAY 'EOP WRONG 1'.
005600     MOVE 'LINE TWO  ' TO PRT-REC.
005700     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
005800         AT END-OF-PAGE DISPLAY 'EOP WRONG 2'.
005900     MOVE 'LINE THREE' TO PRT-REC.
006000     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
006100         AT END-OF-PAGE PERFORM SHOW-LC.
006200     MOVE 'LINE FOUR ' TO PRT-REC.
006300     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
006400         AT END-OF-PAGE PERFORM SHOW-LC.
006500     MOVE 'LINE FIVE ' TO PRT-REC.
006600     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
006700         AT END-OF-PAGE DISPLAY 'EOP WRONG 5'.
006800     MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER TO LC-SHOW.
006900     DISPLAY 'AFTER PAGE LC=' LC-SHOW.
007000     MOVE 'LINE SIX  ' TO PRT-REC.
007100     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING N LINES.
007200     MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER TO LC-SHOW.
007300     DISPLAY 'AFTER N LC=' LC-SHOW.
007400     MOVE 'LINE SEVEN' TO PRT-REC.
007500     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING TOP-OF-FORM.
007600     MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER TO LC-SHOW.
007700     DISPLAY 'AFTER C01 LC=' LC-SHOW.
007800     CLOSE PRT-FILE.
007900     OPEN INPUT RAW-FILE.
008000 RAW-LOOP.
008100     READ RAW-FILE AT END GO TO RAW-DONE.
008200     DISPLAY '[' R-CTL '] ' R-TEXT.
008300     GO TO RAW-LOOP.
008400 RAW-DONE.
008500     CLOSE RAW-FILE.
008600     OPEN INPUT OPT-FILE.
008700     READ OPT-FILE AT END DISPLAY 'OPT ABSENT'.
008800     CLOSE OPT-FILE.
008900     OPEN INPUT OPT2-FILE.
009000     READ OPT2-FILE AT END DISPLAY 'OPT2 WRONG'.
009100     MOVE OPT2-REC TO CARD-SHOW.
009200     DISPLAY 'OPT2 [' CARD-SHOW ']'.
009300     CLOSE OPT2-FILE.
009400     OPEN OUTPUT EXT-FILE.
009500     MOVE 'E1' TO EXT-REC. WRITE EXT-REC.
009600     MOVE 'E2' TO EXT-REC. WRITE EXT-REC.
009700     CLOSE EXT-FILE.
009800     OPEN EXTEND EXT-FILE.
009900     MOVE 'E3' TO EXT-REC. WRITE EXT-REC.
010000     CLOSE EXT-FILE.
010100     OPEN INPUT EXT-IN.
010200 EXT-LOOP.
010300     READ EXT-IN AT END GO TO EXT-DONE.
010400     ADD 1 TO CNT.
010500     GO TO EXT-LOOP.
010600 EXT-DONE.
010700     CLOSE EXT-IN.
010800     DISPLAY 'EXT COUNT ' CNT.
010900     STOP RUN.
011000 SHOW-LC.
011100     MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER TO LC-SHOW.
011200     DISPLAY 'EOP AT LC=' LC-SHOW.
